# NOTE:
# DB74.DBX0.2 and DB74.DBX0.3 failed read-back test because PLC
# may be forcing them FALSE. Keep old values until PLC team confirms.
#
# After PLC team fixes/confirms:
# PLC_ACCEPT_DB=74
# PLC_ACCEPT_BYTE=0
# PLC_ACCEPT_BIT=2
#
# PLC_REJECT_DB=74
# PLC_REJECT_BYTE=0
# PLC_REJECT_BIT=3
# =========================================================
